{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550060/extras/67cc38091e6c014f8a57bea91b2a93cd.webp?t=1748565518\" width=206 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minesweeper is back, but this time it's together! Minesweeper Together is a logical puzzle board game about revealing cells and avoiding mines in a multiplayer environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550060/extras/e079709ea59eaa2854819268793bce48.webp?t=1748565518\" width=330 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you reveal cells, you will find numbers that indicate how many mines are surrounding those numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 5 different preset difficulties:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insane</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diabolical</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The selected difficulty dictates board width, board height, and mine count. You may also choose a custom difficulty to modify these values yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 8 total players online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tutorial for those new or looking for a refresher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 11 &quot;glaggles&quot; to play as, or select the random option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A (almost) working no guessing mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw mode which allows you and others to doodle on the board to plan moves or just to have fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh take on the Minesweeper UI, with 39 selectable gameplay backgrounds with an included random option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 board themes to choose from with an included dark mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you're in a game, its up to you and your friends what to do on the board. Plan, draw, solve, or speedrun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come play Minesweeper, Together!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Winning Together","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550060/b6cb46be0bf03f0395a7b2c00ea00fc846f830aa.jpg"},{"name":"Easy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550060/1505b30237adf1a7bdc7de4cb59d06fae10f6d11.jpg"},{"name":"Medium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550060/a58587f8bf72c0bb24d57023c89d2e112f823525.jpg"},{"name":"Hard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550060/0e1305a233865f9cabafaf3236906993d6ae17c9.jpg"},{"name":"Insane","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550060/47bc673776ac15d454353e0b700ca2233eb90570.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky Number 8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550060/34ec7ee3706bcb06881910846d297ab00a575459.jpg"},{"name":"Flagless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550060/44febadb7267153ede6262ae105c2b73d100bc3e.jpg"},{"name":"Minesweeper Alone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550060/85f562572e5ba8e0dda0e4e337b4f566ef4cdc41.jpg"},{"name":"Well Done!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550060/33d440e6ee3f7f15559bbc6f6a1728c220fe219e.jpg"},{"name":"Diabolical","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550060/bb392375434af78600cd69907933088da67bfe15.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550060?t=1748565518","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550060?t=1748565518","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550060/823f0698aba5526ce1d132c08b6a0984e86ba9cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748565518","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550060/823f0698aba5526ce1d132c08b6a0984e86ba9cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748565518","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550060/extras/67cc38091e6c014f8a57bea91b2a93cd.webp?t=1748565518\" width=206 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minesweeper is back, but this time it's together! Minesweeper Together is a logical puzzle board game about revealing cells and avoiding mines in a multiplayer environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550060/extras/e079709ea59eaa2854819268793bce48.webp?t=1748565518\" width=330 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you reveal cells, you will find numbers that indicate how many mines are surrounding those numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 5 different preset difficulties:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insane</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diabolical</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The selected difficulty dictates board width, board height, and mine count. You may also choose a custom difficulty to modify these values yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 8 total players online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tutorial for those new or looking for a refresher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 11 &quot;glaggles&quot; to play as, or select the random option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A (almost) working no guessing mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw mode which allows you and others to doodle on the board to plan moves or just to have fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh take on the Minesweeper UI, with 39 selectable gameplay backgrounds with an included random option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 board themes to choose from with an included dark mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you're in a game, its up to you and your friends what to do on the board. Plan, draw, solve, or speedrun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come play Minesweeper, Together!</p>","developers":["anchikai"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550060/9f366ef866212b445fb08c6c2e249a3e9ef4d530/header.jpg?t=1748565518","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></u